hes its SLA.','Ticket {{ticketId}} breached SLA','Ticket {{ticketNumber}} has breached its SLA by {{breachedByMinutes}} minutes. Please review and take corrective action.','ticket_sla_breached_email.html',NULL,'ticket_sla_breached_inapp.html','[\"IN_APP\"]',_binary '','2025-01-10 09:25:00.000000','2025-09-29 03:44:59.280145',1),(7,'TICKET_ASSIGNED_REQUESTER','Ticket Assigned - Requester','Notifies the requester when their ticket assignment is updated.','Ticket {{ticketId}} assigned','Hello {{recipientName}}, your ticket {{ticketId}} has been assigned.','ticket_assigned_requester_email.html',NULL,'ticket_assigned_requester_inapp.html','[\"EMAIL\", \"IN_APP\"]',_binary '','2025-01-10 09:30:00.000000','2025-12-22 01:37:42.252780',1),(8,'TICKET_RESOLVED','Ticket Resolved','Notifies the requester when their ticket has been resolved.','Ticket {{ticketId}} resolved',NULL,'/email/TicketResolved.ftl','TicketResolved.ftl',NULL,'[\"EMAIL\", \"SMS\", \"IN_APP\"]',_binary '','2026-01-27 12:41:28.749152','2026-01-27 14:01:28.736269',1),(9,'TICKET_LINKED_TO_MASTER','Ticket Linked to Master Ticket','Notifies the requester if their ticket has been linked to a master ticket.',NULL,NULL,'/email/TicketLinkedToMaster.ftl','TicketLinkedToMaster.ftl',NULL,'[\"EMAIL\", \"SMS\", \"IN_APP\"]',_binary '','2026-01-27 12:41:28.755854','2026-01-27 14:01:28.736473',1);
